  "description": "Automatic object mapping and advanced pagination library for .NET, powered by MapFlux and EF Core. Supports dynamic filtering, sorting, global search, and cursor-based (keyset) pagination.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "MapFlux.Pagination",
