  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds opt-in strict mode for unknown/invalid filter, sort and search input; opt-in deterministic offset-page ordering; opt-in cursor strict mode; opt-out cursor total count; an in-memory ToPaged pipeline overload; and a package icon. Fixes JSON, enum and culture-dependent filter values, unknown first sort criteria, culture-dependent search casing, MaxPageSize enforcement, Skip overflow, cursor precision/culture/direction/Before-page/comparable-type bugs, repeated-registration profile loss, and PagedResult zero-page-size overflow. Adds a net10.0 target, SourceLink, deterministic builds and full public API XML docs. See CHANGELOG.md.",
